{"id":"n22617-1-7","stage":5,"title":"감탄 · 感叹","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22617-1-7-1","ko":"이 인형들은 실제 인물들과 정말 닮았어요.","zh":"这些玩偶和真实人物真的非常相像呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"인형들은","meaning":"娃娃","explanation":"인형：娃娃；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"인형","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70776","senseId":"1","lemma":"인형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인형들은","audio":"/audio/c498e2ae48e2e50f5a4f.mp3"}},{"text":"실제","meaning":"实际","explanation":"실제：实际。","readings":[{"term":"실제","audio":"/audio/674150f61887a603ffc5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14108","senseId":"1","lemma":"실제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실제","audio":"/audio/674150f61887a603ffc5.mp3"}},{"text":"인물들과","meaning":"人物","explanation":"인물：人物；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"인물","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25066","senseId":"3","lemma":"인물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인물들과","audio":"/audio/359276c376f873c5c63d.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"닮았어요.","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮았어요","audio":"/audio/66203fc58add8b944f72.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"0107283a24c66d34","term":"인형","zh":"娃娃","audio":"/audio/0107283a24c66d348a28.mp3","entryId":"70776","definition":"做成人或动物模样的玩具。","pronunciation":["인형"]},{"id":"674150f61887a603","term":"실제","zh":"实际","audio":"/audio/674150f61887a603ffc5.mp3","entryId":"14108","definition":"真实的状态或事实。","pronunciation":["실쩨"]},{"id":"16673e931e1465c5","term":"인물","zh":"人物","audio":"/audio/16673e931e1465c54d5d.mp3","entryId":"25066","definition":"在一定的状况下担任一定角色的人。","pronunciation":["인물"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/45c12d31a879a9d2865f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22617-1-7-2","ko":"네, 표정 하나까지 비슷해서 감탄이 절로 나오네요.","zh":"是啊，连表情都一模一样，让人不禁赞叹不已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"표정","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}},{"text":"하나까지","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나까지","audio":"/audio/f620f2d57984c4417fef.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷해서","meaning":"类似，相似，相近","explanation":"비슷하다：类似，相似，相近；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"1","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷해서","audio":"/audio/9fc91d8d5fa69dc95e13.mp3"}},{"text":"감탄이","meaning":"感叹","explanation":"감탄：感叹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감탄","audio":"/audio/f0bc9ed4fd1ddf990357.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22617","senseId":"1","lemma":"감탄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감탄이","audio":"/audio/7b7465b4f4fc12eaa86e.mp3"}},{"text":"절로","meaning":"自然而然地，油然而生地","explanation":"절로：自然而然地，油然而生地。","readings":[{"term":"절로","audio":"/audio/29c0e730004c8be95ff6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83418","senseId":"1","lemma":"절로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절로","audio":"/audio/29c0e730004c8be95ff6.mp3"}},{"text":"나오네요.","meaning":"出现","explanation":"나오다：出现；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"27","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오네요","audio":"/audio/87cb1fd51a3a936020ed.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"9903f9b7bf915b82","term":"비슷하다","zh":"类似，相似，相近","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3","entryId":"65864","definition":"两种或两种以上的大小、模样、状态及性质等虽不完全相同，但有很多相像之处。","pronunciation":["비스타다"]},{"id":"f0bc9ed4fd1ddf99","term":"감탄","zh":"感叹","audio":"/audio/f0bc9ed4fd1ddf990357.mp3","entryId":"22617","definition":"内心深深地感受。","pronunciation":["감ː탄"]},{"id":"29c0e730004c8be9","term":"절로","zh":"自然而然地，油然而生地","audio":"/audio/29c0e730004c8be95ff6.mp3","entryId":"83418","definition":"不借助别的力量而自动地；或不费力气而自然地。","pronunciation":["절로"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"现出关于某事的言词或评价等。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d9ce522711ab5b13650.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.346,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=22617","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1727,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，连表情都一模一样，让人不禁赞叹不已。","电视剧里的主角们可是为了爱情甚至愿意牺牲自己的生命呢。","这些玩偶和真实人物真的非常相像呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，连表情都一模一样，让人不禁赞叹不已。","这些玩偶和真实人物真的非常相像呢。","电视剧里的主角们可是为了爱情甚至愿意牺牲自己的生命呢。"],"answer":0}]}
